  #line-at(70.805pt, 28.2pt, ".: Investigation of the Physical Mechanism behind Retention Loss in FeFETs with MIFIFIS Gate Structure                                                                                      1 ")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 9pt, weight: "bold", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(56.874pt, 250.077pt, "Abstract")
  #set text(font: "Arial", size: 9pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(93.477pt, 250.077pt, "—A ")
  #line-at(122.397pt, 250.077pt, "Metal-Gate ")
  #line-at(181.791pt, 250.077pt, "Blocking ")
  #line-at(233.391pt, 250.077pt, "Layer ")
  #line-at(270.822pt, 250.077pt, "(GBL)- ")
  #line-at(46.776pt, 260.4pt, "Ferroelectric-Tunnel Dielectric Layer (TDL)-Ferroelectric ")
  #line-at(46.767pt, 270.723pt, "-Channel ")
  #line-at(95.604pt, 270.723pt, "Insulator ")
  #line-at(143.724pt, 270.723pt, "(Ch.IL)-Si ")
  #line-at(193.884pt, 270.723pt, "(MIFIFIS) ")
  #line-at(242.12pt, 270.723pt, "structure ")
  #line-at(291.324pt, 270.723pt, "is ")
  #line-at(46.767pt, 281.163pt, "proposed to achieve a larger MW for applications in ")
  #line-at(46.785pt, 291.486pt, "Fe-NAND. However, the large retention loss (RL) in the ")
  #line-at(46.785pt, 301.809pt, "MIFIFIS structure restricts its application. In this work, we ")
  #line-at(46.794pt, 312.132pt, "vary the physical thickness of the GBL and TDL, and ")
  #line-at(46.794pt, 322.572pt, "conduct an in-depth analysis of the energy bands of the ")
  #line-at(46.794pt, 332.895pt, "gate structure to investigate the physical mechanism ")
  #line-at(46.794pt, 343.218pt, "behind the RL in FeFETs with the MIFIFIS structure. The ")
  #line-at(46.794pt, 353.541pt, "physical origin of the RL is that the electric field direction ")
  #line-at(46.794pt, 363.981pt, "across the TDL reduces the potential barrier provided by ")
  #line-at(46.794pt, 374.304pt, "the ferroelectric near the silicon substrate. Based on the ")
  #line-at(46.794pt, 384.627pt, "above physical mechanism, the RL can be reduced to 12% ")
  #line-at(46.794pt, 394.95pt, "and 0.2% by redesigning the gate structure or reducing the ")
  #line-at(46.776pt, 405.39pt, "pulse amplitude, respectively. Our work contributes to a ")
  #line-at(46.776pt, 415.713pt, "deeper understanding of the physical mechanism behind ")
  #line-at(46.785pt, 426.036pt, "the RL in FeFETs with the MIFIFIS gate structure. It ")
  #line-at(46.785pt, 436.359pt, "provides guidance for enhancing the reliability of FeFETs. ")
